## Node identity and runtime flags for hecate_society.
-name ${HECATE_NODE_NAME}@${HECATE_NODE_HOST}
-setcookie ${HECATE_COOKIE}

+K true

## A tick is CPU-bound arithmetic over a population, so the schedulers are the
## resource that matters and the async thread pool is not on that path. Left at a
## modest 8 until there is something to measure; a number chosen before the first
## measurement is a guess either way, and this one is cheap to revisit.
+A 8
